{"resource": {"name": "Plano Fix It Completions", "id": "s9cc-a5gg", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This dataset contains information on the Plano Fix It Program. The program information has been edited from its original output in two ways:\n\n1) ID numbers and Addresses of Projects have been removed for privacy reasons. \n2) The raw data has been grouped into months based on the date of the Fix It request. Within 2015, there have been more than 8,000 requests. The large volume of individual data points puts a strain on viewing via the Dashboard and has been reduced in order to provide a smoother user experience. \n\nAdditionally, this data is representative of only 2015 requests. Currently, more requests and completions are occurring for the new year. \n\nLastly, this dataset is organized as follows: The first several columns show date and total numbers for project completions, requests, in-progress, etc. The latter columns breakdown the total numbers by the type of service requested whether it is for water violations, animal services, public works projects, etc.", "attribution": "The City of Plano", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-07-26T13:38:23.000Z", "createdAt": "2016-02-03T19:04:43.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-07-26T13:38:22.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-07-26T13:38:23.000Z", "columns_name": ["Received Police (Public Safety)", "Received Parks and Recreation", "Completed Franchised Utilities", "Requests Total", "In Progress Total", "Completed Total", "Other Property Standards", "Completed Environmental Waste Services", "Completed Animal Services", "Received No Department Assigned", "Received Public Works", "Dates", "Submitted Total", "Submitted Public Works", "Completed No Department Assigned", "Submitted Customer & Utility Services", "Submitted Animal Services", "Other Public Works", "In Progress Public Works", "Completed Public Works", "Completed Police (Public Safety)", "Completed Parks and R